    `MapleUI\Organisms\MuiCollectionGridSelection.cs`,
    `MuiKanbanBoardLogic.cs`, and `MuiSidebarFlatten.cs` (Maple.UI
    Windows-phase organisms wave N6, #3012 — collections/navigation/
    inspector panels) are the same split for the Collection Grid/List
    View, Kanban Board, and Sidebar organisms: each is plain C#
    (System/System.Collections.Generic/System.Linq only, namespace
    `Maple.UI`), so the click/Ctrl-click/Shift-click selection math, the
    cross-column card-move-and-reorder logic, and the tree-to-flat-row
    walk are all exercisable here without a live Window.
    `MuiPointerModifierReader.cs` (the shared live-keyboard-state reader
